omx-clap-host (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.5.0
  * lv2 host test: take the thread baseline once the last rate's worker is
    gone (#48)
  * lv2: refuse a state longer than 1 MiB on load (#48)
  * docs: a state longer than 1 MiB is refused (#48)
  * lv2: load a pset:Preset through clap.preset-load
  * lv2: save and restore the state through clap.state
  * lv2: refuse state:mapPath and state:makePath in the fixture, as the twins
    prove
  * lv2_clap_test: warm-up activated at 512, run at 256 (#45)
  * lv2_clap_test: a reset whose worker thread cannot start (#13)
  * lv2: a reset whose worker cannot start again breaks the instance until
    activate (#13)

